### Form chips for an existing trip (VIEWER+): destination interests + suggested price level. No quota; 60 per user per hour
GET {{host}}/explore/suggestions?tripId={{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept-Language: id

### Form chips for a new trip (destination + month of the start date)
GET {{host}}/explore/suggestions?destination=Tokyo&month=2026-03
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search (EDITOR+ on the trip). Counts 1 of 10 daily searches (resets 00:00 WIB)
POST {{host}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}",
  "focusArea": "Ubud",
  "priceLevel": "MEDIUM",
  "interests": ["FOOD", "NATURE"],
  "extraInterests": ["Diving"],
  "style": "SANTAI",
  "notes": "tanpa babi",
  "excludePlaceIds": [],
  "newSearch": true
}

### Background next batch while swiping: does NOT count against the quota
POST {{host}}/recommendations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "tripId": "{{tripId}}", "priceLevel": "MEDIUM", "interests": ["FOOD", "NATURE"], "style": "SANTAI",
  "excludePlaceIds": ["paste placeIds already shown"], "newSearch": false
}

### Swipe: LIKE or SKIP (upsert) -> 204. On LIKE the client also creates the itinerary item (dayDate null, source AI)
POST {{host}}/recommendations/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "tripId": "{{tripId}}", "placeId": "ChIJ...", "placeName": "Tanah Lot", "category": "ATTRACTION", "action": "SKIP" }

### Undo the last swipe -> 204 (idempotent)
DELETE {{host}}/recommendations/feedback/{{tripId}}/ChIJ...
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
